    "regime_notes": "5d IC was positive in 2020-2024 (+0.036550), 2025-2027 (+0.040183), and 2028-2029 (+0.027916), but weakened to +0.002345 in 2030-09-02. The 10d decay remains positive but fails the ICIR gate. Interpret small-universe estimates conservatively.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20310904_breadth_transition_reversal_5d_signal.csv"
